WEBVTT

01:24.880 --> 01:27.360
ADAPTED FROM
THE LEGEND OF KUNSHAN JADE BY TAN TIANYIN

01:34.760 --> 01:37.200
-Come on. Greet our guest.
-Okay.

01:37.280 --> 01:38.560
No need.

01:39.520 --> 01:41.200
Wuyi, how are you doing?

01:41.720 --> 01:43.040
Zijing.

01:43.880 --> 01:45.000
You look thin.

01:48.000 --> 01:50.080
-Mr. Yuchi.
-Duanwu.

01:50.960 --> 01:53.400
No, I should call you Ms. Su now.

01:53.480 --> 01:55.520
Mr. Yuchi, you are well informed.

01:55.600 --> 01:57.200
You're famous in Yangzhou.

01:57.280 --> 01:58.480
I asked around.

01:58.560 --> 02:00.680
Many people showed me the way.

02:02.520 --> 02:04.760
I'm flattered.

02:06.280 --> 02:07.800
You started from scratch in Yangzhou

02:07.880 --> 02:09.560
and achieved so much.

02:10.639 --> 02:16.360
Your looks and abilities
are outstanding and remarkable.

02:16.440 --> 02:19.680
My Clear Mind is nothing compared

02:19.760 --> 02:21.440
to your Langhuan Dockyard.

02:21.520 --> 02:23.320
It's just a small business.

02:23.840 --> 02:24.960
I was just lucky.

02:26.840 --> 02:29.320
Mr. Yuchi, let me introduce them to you.

02:29.400 --> 02:30.440
This is Yunxiu,

02:30.960 --> 02:33.520
the Master Artisan of Clear Mind.

02:34.120 --> 02:35.000
Mr. Yuchi, nice to meet you.

02:37.080 --> 02:39.120
They are my right-hand men.

02:39.200 --> 02:42.120
I am Yingtao. He is Gaoshou.
He's my subordinate.

02:46.320 --> 02:49.520
-This is Mr. Zhang.
-Mr. Zhang, we know each other.

02:49.600 --> 02:50.800
You know each other?

02:51.320 --> 02:52.840
Mr. Zhang was anxious

02:52.920 --> 02:54.720
after you were attacked.

02:54.800 --> 02:56.240
He came to me to look for you.

02:56.760 --> 02:58.560
Mr. Yuchi, how are you?

02:59.080 --> 03:02.120
We were anxious to find them
at Langhuan Dockyard.

03:02.200 --> 03:03.600
We meet again today.

03:03.680 --> 03:05.360
When I first arrived in Yangzhou,

03:05.440 --> 03:09.040
I heard that there was a fair

03:09.120 --> 03:11.600
and impartial inspector.

03:11.680 --> 03:13.480
It must be you.

03:14.360 --> 03:15.200
I'm flattered.

03:15.280 --> 03:16.280
-Let's sit down and talk.
-Okay.

03:16.360 --> 03:17.440
-Please.
-Please, Mr. Yuchi.

03:17.520 --> 03:18.400
Okay.

03:20.960 --> 03:22.040
This way.

03:25.680 --> 03:26.680
Please.

03:28.520 --> 03:29.560
Have a seat.

03:34.440 --> 03:35.520
Mr. Yuchi.

03:36.040 --> 03:38.360
-Taste the tea in Yangzhou.
-Okay.

03:38.440 --> 03:40.280
Have you ever been to Yangzhou before?

03:45.600 --> 03:48.840
It's much better than desert tea.

03:51.320 --> 03:52.400
I didn't expect you

03:52.480 --> 03:54.120
to be able to start Clear Mind

03:54.200 --> 03:58.480
from scratch after such a big event.

03:59.080 --> 04:00.520
And you're doing great.

04:00.600 --> 04:04.360
If your father and mother see this
above there, they will be happy.

04:07.520 --> 04:08.840
If my father and mother

04:08.920 --> 04:10.480
see this above there,

04:11.880 --> 04:13.200
they will be happy.

04:16.160 --> 04:17.040
Wuyi.

04:17.720 --> 04:21.320
Why did you come to Yangzhou?

04:22.880 --> 04:25.520
There's a lot you don't know.

04:25.600 --> 04:28.680
I am no longer the owner
of Langhuan Dockyard.

04:31.480 --> 04:34.560
I was anxious

04:34.640 --> 04:36.240
when you were attacked
at Langhuan Dockyard.

04:36.320 --> 04:38.240
I looked for you many times,
but I couldn't find you.

04:38.840 --> 04:41.200
I felt hopeless.

04:41.280 --> 04:42.280
Later,

04:42.360 --> 04:45.120
officers came to me many times.

04:45.200 --> 04:47.600
Everyone at Langhuan Dockyard
was in a panic.

04:47.680 --> 04:50.880
So, I decided to quit.

04:52.160 --> 04:55.080
Wouldn't it be better
to come to the southeast

04:55.160 --> 04:56.280
to enjoy the mountains and rivers?

04:58.720 --> 05:00.040
So were we.

05:00.120 --> 05:03.040
We've been through a lot
to get settled in Yangzhou.

05:07.400 --> 05:08.880
I'm here to see you.

05:08.960 --> 05:10.240
As the host,

05:10.320 --> 05:12.160
you should take good care of me.

05:12.240 --> 05:13.920
Don't worry.
I've arranged everything for you.

05:14.640 --> 05:15.840
Great.

05:16.920 --> 05:17.920
Come on.

05:21.120 --> 05:23.960
I heard Clear Mind is famous
for its glassware.

05:24.680 --> 05:28.440
Here's a Persian glass bracelet for you.

05:29.640 --> 05:30.760
Mr. Yuchi.

05:31.280 --> 05:32.400
It's an expensive gift.

05:34.200 --> 05:36.920
Good things should be given to people
who understand them.

05:38.400 --> 05:39.320
Since Wuyi wanted to give it to you,

05:39.400 --> 05:40.560
just take it.

05:41.480 --> 05:43.520
Okay, I'll take it.

05:44.120 --> 05:45.600
Thank you, Mr. Yuchi.

05:46.120 --> 05:47.480
What are you going to do to thank me?

05:49.480 --> 05:50.840
I will take you on a tour

05:50.920 --> 05:53.000
of Yangzhou. What do you say?

05:53.600 --> 05:55.360
Great.

05:55.440 --> 05:56.640
You've been working hard lately.

05:56.720 --> 05:59.400
Let's close our shop today and go out.

05:59.480 --> 06:00.960
We can go out.

06:01.040 --> 06:02.080
-We can go out.
-Great.

06:02.160 --> 06:03.960
-Gaoshou.
-Don't be rude.

06:08.680 --> 06:09.840
Mr. Zhang.

06:10.360 --> 06:12.560
Come with us if you're not busy.

06:13.280 --> 06:16.200
Mr. Zhang has something important to do.
I don't think he has time.

06:17.040 --> 06:19.160
I don't have important things to do today.

06:19.800 --> 06:21.560
If you, an official,
socialize too much with businessmen,

06:21.640 --> 06:22.560
people will start talking.

06:22.640 --> 06:24.800
As the saying goes,
"A clean hand wants no washing."

06:25.800 --> 06:26.920
Mr. Yuchi.

06:30.680 --> 06:31.640
Please.

06:31.720 --> 06:32.560
Let's go.

06:33.520 --> 06:34.600
You don't have to go.

06:36.720 --> 06:38.280
I'll take you on a good tour of Yangzhou.

06:38.360 --> 06:39.360
Thank you.

06:42.920 --> 06:43.960
Mr. Yuchi.

06:44.040 --> 06:46.080
This is the view of Jiangnan.

06:46.160 --> 06:48.880
It should be different from the desert.

06:48.960 --> 06:50.840
If the world's beautiful scenery is three,

06:50.920 --> 06:52.840
Yangzhou occupies two shares.

06:53.880 --> 06:56.240
Watch singing and dancing
on the bridge under the moon.

06:56.320 --> 06:59.440
There are streets and water but no horses.

06:59.960 --> 07:01.120
-Please.
-This way.

07:02.760 --> 07:03.680
Ms. Su.

07:03.760 --> 07:05.400
I heard that there are painters
in Yangzhou

07:05.480 --> 07:07.360
who can paint people very similar.

07:07.440 --> 07:10.000
Let's go to them and paint
a painting of us.

07:10.080 --> 07:11.600
Where can we find them?

07:13.480 --> 07:15.680
Mr. Zhang, you can paint, right?

07:15.760 --> 07:16.600
I can't do it.

07:16.680 --> 07:17.920
I want to be in the painting.

07:18.440 --> 07:20.680
We want to paint a painting
of Clear Mind's people.

07:22.160 --> 07:24.000
Mr. Yan is not from Clear Mind.

07:24.080 --> 07:25.720
What does it have to do with you?

07:27.080 --> 07:28.520
You have a thick skin.

07:29.320 --> 07:31.640
Let me see how the Go skills
of the Central Plains people are.

07:31.720 --> 07:33.440
Let's go.

07:33.520 --> 07:34.680
You like it, too, right?

07:45.720 --> 07:46.760
The game is set.

07:48.880 --> 07:50.240
Black is going to lose.

07:56.000 --> 07:57.720
Good.

07:58.880 --> 08:01.280
Tang's Go pieces are pottery.

08:01.360 --> 08:02.880
They're rough.

08:02.960 --> 08:04.280
And they don't sound good.

08:04.840 --> 08:06.720
That's why I lost.

08:07.400 --> 08:08.840
Where are my Go pieces?

08:13.200 --> 08:14.040
Look.

08:14.120 --> 08:15.760
They are jade pieces.

08:15.840 --> 08:18.280
-Each one is a one-of-a-kind treasure.
-Jade pieces?

08:18.360 --> 08:21.640
They are rare in Yangzhou
and even in Tang.

08:21.720 --> 08:23.520
Can I have a look?

08:23.600 --> 08:25.000
They are national treasures of Haidong.

08:25.600 --> 08:28.080
They are all unique.

08:29.520 --> 08:31.320
Unique.

08:31.400 --> 08:32.280
What are you thinking about?

08:32.360 --> 08:33.760
They are good pieces.

08:33.840 --> 08:36.280
Let's have another game with your pieces.

08:36.360 --> 08:38.200
You must have thought

08:38.280 --> 08:41.320
-of a money-making business.
-Let's have another game.

08:45.880 --> 08:46.920
Yunxiu.

08:48.360 --> 08:49.280
Yunxiu.

08:50.080 --> 08:51.080
Come here.

08:53.840 --> 08:55.120
Do you remember

08:55.200 --> 08:56.880
when we made black glass?

08:57.560 --> 08:58.760
Yes.

08:58.840 --> 09:00.520
What's the use of it?

09:00.600 --> 09:02.200
No wonder she's a shopkeeper.

09:02.280 --> 09:04.640
She thinks about business all the time.

09:04.720 --> 09:07.520
She was born to be a businesswoman.

09:07.600 --> 09:09.720
You have a good eye for business.

09:09.800 --> 09:11.320
You can find business opportunities
everywhere.

09:12.040 --> 09:13.440
Duanwu.

09:13.520 --> 09:15.480
The colors and materials
are easy to handle.

09:15.560 --> 09:17.840
But it's difficult

09:17.920 --> 09:18.800
to make them the same size.

09:20.800 --> 09:22.560
It is difficult

09:22.640 --> 09:24.000
to make them the same size.

09:26.960 --> 09:29.840
Duanwu, why don't we try
using the mold casting process?

09:29.920 --> 09:32.640
We can make a wax piece first.

09:32.720 --> 09:34.480
Then, make a mold with it.

09:34.560 --> 09:37.120
Next, pour the melted glass into it.

09:37.640 --> 09:41.520
Finally, cut it and flatten it
while it's hot.

09:42.720 --> 09:44.240
We can give it a try.

09:44.320 --> 09:48.000
The ratio of materials must be accurate.

09:48.600 --> 09:51.400
-You have to be very careful.
-More.

09:58.120 --> 09:59.760
Ready to open to the kiln.

10:00.360 --> 10:01.640
Yingtao, get ready.

10:02.480 --> 10:03.320
Enough.

10:05.560 --> 10:06.520
Okay.

10:07.240 --> 10:09.160
Be careful. Wait for it to cool down.

10:15.000 --> 10:17.080
Mr. Qin, please take a look.

10:17.160 --> 10:18.440
This is a finished product.

10:19.040 --> 10:20.120
Good.

10:22.640 --> 10:24.200
Nice texture.

10:33.920 --> 10:37.080
Yangzhou is famous for having treasures
from all over the world.

10:37.160 --> 10:39.600
Playing Go is an elegant thing.

10:39.680 --> 10:42.640
But there are no merchants in Yangzhou

10:42.720 --> 10:44.640
who can make good Go pieces.

10:45.240 --> 10:48.000
Miss, your Go pieces are nice.

10:50.000 --> 10:51.120
Ladies,

10:51.720 --> 10:54.120
Your pieces look good

10:54.200 --> 10:55.320
and crystal clear.

10:55.840 --> 10:58.040
Where did you get them?

10:58.120 --> 11:00.160
What's this made of?
Is it made of crystal?

11:00.240 --> 11:02.920
It's rare.

11:03.000 --> 11:04.720
When you look up at it,
it looks like jasper.

11:05.320 --> 11:06.360
When you look down at it,
it looks like black paint.

11:06.440 --> 11:07.960
It's impossible.

11:08.040 --> 11:10.880
These are Clear Mind's original glass
Go pieces.

11:10.960 --> 11:13.000
Your pieces are made of glass?

11:13.080 --> 11:15.400
Can your glass pieces

11:15.480 --> 11:16.960
match my jade pieces?

11:17.040 --> 11:19.720
They can't match your jade pieces.

11:20.880 --> 11:24.160
Glass pieces feel smooth

11:25.160 --> 11:28.240
and sound clear.

11:29.080 --> 11:31.600
Each one has a different pattern on it.

11:32.360 --> 11:33.960
It's so special.

11:34.040 --> 11:37.480
More importantly,
they show different colors

11:37.560 --> 11:39.720
in different weather.

11:40.360 --> 11:41.960
That's true.

11:42.040 --> 11:43.920
Such good Go pieces

11:44.440 --> 11:45.560
only cost 100,000 mace.

11:45.640 --> 11:46.800
What?

11:46.880 --> 11:48.920
-One hundred thousand mace?
-It's cheap.

11:49.000 --> 11:51.400
After listening to you,

11:51.480 --> 11:52.520
I want to buy it.

11:53.200 --> 11:55.880
Where did you say you bought it?

11:55.960 --> 11:58.120
-Clear Mind.
-Where?

11:58.200 --> 12:00.200
Clear Mind.

12:00.280 --> 12:03.240
-Clear Mind?
-Clear Mind?

12:04.320 --> 12:05.480
I'm interested.

12:05.560 --> 12:07.040
I'll buy one.

12:07.120 --> 12:08.600
-Sir, wait.
-Let's go together.

12:09.200 --> 12:10.880
I have a list for ordering.

12:10.960 --> 12:13.240
Do you mean I can order from you?

12:13.320 --> 12:14.920
-Yes.
-I'll order one.

12:15.000 --> 12:16.040
-Me too.
-Me too.

12:16.120 --> 12:17.760
-I'll have one.
-Me too.

12:17.840 --> 12:19.360
Don't rush.

12:19.440 --> 12:21.880
Clear Mind makes them every day.
You can order as much as you want.

12:21.960 --> 12:24.640
Pay a deposit of 10,000 mace
and you can get one at Clear Mind.

12:24.720 --> 12:25.800
It's cheap.

12:25.880 --> 12:29.000
-I want one.
-Don't rush. Come on.

12:29.080 --> 12:30.120
-I want one.
-I want one.

12:30.200 --> 12:31.080
Everybody will have it.

12:32.120 --> 12:33.160
Don't rush.

12:33.240 --> 12:35.160
-You can order as much as you want.
-I want one.

12:35.240 --> 12:36.080
Everybody will have it.

12:38.160 --> 12:40.520
Lady Shijiu, we're out of stock.

12:40.600 --> 12:42.480
Let's stock up.

12:42.560 --> 12:45.680
If you're tired, get some rest.

12:45.760 --> 12:48.920
-I'll do the chores.
-Is there anyone here?

12:49.000 --> 12:50.960
Is there anyone here?
Is there anyone here?

12:52.320 --> 12:53.800
We're not selling anymore.

12:54.640 --> 12:56.400
We are not here to buy things.

12:56.480 --> 12:57.840
We are just looking around.

12:58.480 --> 13:00.040
We have no goods.
What do you want to look at?

13:00.120 --> 13:02.400
There's nothing in your shop.

13:02.480 --> 13:04.560
Are you for sale?

13:05.640 --> 13:06.560
What are you talking about?

13:06.640 --> 13:08.320
We're leaving.

13:09.040 --> 13:10.800
-You can't come in here!
-Out of the way!

13:10.880 --> 13:12.240
We're closed today!

13:12.320 --> 13:13.200
Let go.

13:13.280 --> 13:15.000
-Let me touch you. Let me touch you.
-Let go!

13:15.080 --> 13:16.400
-What do you want?
-What do you want?

13:16.480 --> 13:17.800
-Let's go!
-Let go!

13:17.880 --> 13:19.080
-What do you want?
-Let's go.

13:19.160 --> 13:20.600
Stop! Give it back!

13:20.680 --> 13:21.760
You evil guys!

13:21.840 --> 13:23.520
-Let go!
-Don't take my money!

13:23.600 --> 13:25.480
-What are you talking about?
-Give me my money back!

13:25.560 --> 13:27.280
-Stop!
-It's ours!

13:27.360 --> 13:28.600
-What's wrong, Ms. Su?
-Give it to me!

13:28.680 --> 13:29.600
Don't leave!

13:30.760 --> 13:32.320
-Give it back!
-Stop!

13:32.400 --> 13:33.880
Let go! Get out of here!

13:33.960 --> 13:35.960
-Stop!
-Don't leave!

13:36.040 --> 13:39.000
-Stop!
-Scum! How can you bully girls?

13:39.080 --> 13:40.080
Shame on you!

13:40.160 --> 13:42.880
You're evil!

13:42.960 --> 13:45.400
-We'll see!
-I dare you to come again!

13:45.480 --> 13:46.520
Get out of here!

14:13.440 --> 14:14.880
You went through a lot
to get Zhenlang Pavilion back,

14:14.960 --> 14:15.880
but you make it like that.

14:16.480 --> 14:18.000
You did whatever it took

14:18.080 --> 14:19.600
to get it back.

14:20.760 --> 14:22.160
Since you're alive,

14:22.240 --> 14:23.560
you should move on…

14:27.320 --> 14:28.400
and live well.

14:36.360 --> 14:37.440
Let's go.

14:47.960 --> 14:50.320
Prince Ying
is about to arrive in Yangzhou.

14:50.840 --> 14:54.360
Are you going to meet him like this?

14:54.440 --> 14:56.640
Su Muzhe is too hateful.

14:57.400 --> 14:58.360
I want her dead.

14:58.440 --> 15:00.600
Did you forget Prince Ying's order?

15:01.120 --> 15:02.720
Don't act rashly.

15:02.800 --> 15:04.720
But I can't put up with it.

15:12.320 --> 15:13.160
Help me.

15:13.240 --> 15:14.800
When you get it done,

15:14.880 --> 15:17.240
I'll give you
the Jubao House's Chengnan branch.

15:20.720 --> 15:23.160
Aren't you afraid
that Prince Ying will blame you?

15:23.240 --> 15:25.160
Prince Ying wanted to come here

15:26.040 --> 15:29.160
because of Yan Zijing and Su Muzhe.

15:29.240 --> 15:31.400
His purpose should be the same as mine.

15:32.080 --> 15:35.640
I'm not interested
in your Chengnan branch.

15:37.760 --> 15:42.360
What I want is in Su Muzhe's hands.

15:46.000 --> 15:48.920
If you kill her, you'll get what you want.

15:57.960 --> 15:59.280
Okay.

16:00.760 --> 16:02.320
I promise you.

16:02.840 --> 16:05.400
I heard that Clear Mind
has three branches to open.

16:05.480 --> 16:06.440
-Please go in.
-Really?

16:06.520 --> 16:07.520
Let's have a look.

16:07.600 --> 16:09.040
-Have a look.
-Their business is good.

16:09.120 --> 16:10.320
-There's a long line again.
-Yeah.

16:10.400 --> 16:11.280
So many people.

16:11.360 --> 16:13.600
-Miss, come and have a look.
-Slow down.

16:14.280 --> 16:16.120
Miss, have a look.

16:16.200 --> 16:17.160
Look.

16:17.240 --> 16:18.960
This is our new glass hairpin.

16:19.560 --> 16:21.720
-Please sign here.
-Okay.

16:21.800 --> 16:22.800
-I want one.
-It's really lively.

16:23.800 --> 16:25.120
-Have you heard it?
-Come on.

16:25.200 --> 16:26.400
They're opening branches.

16:26.480 --> 16:29.960
I heard. She's amazing.

16:30.040 --> 16:32.840
Glass pieces are nice and cheap.

16:33.400 --> 16:34.400
-That's true.
-I want one, too.

16:34.480 --> 16:36.320
-Let's buy some.
-Go.

16:36.400 --> 16:37.320
Write more clearly.

16:39.720 --> 16:41.640
Please sign here. Thank you.

16:43.320 --> 16:44.400
Excuse me.

16:45.000 --> 16:46.600
Ms. Su. Mr. Kang is here.

16:52.360 --> 16:53.640
-Come on.
-I got it.

16:54.240 --> 16:55.880
-Wait a moment.
-Okay.

16:57.040 --> 16:58.640
Thank you.

17:01.200 --> 17:03.200
I'm sorry I didn't greet you.

17:03.280 --> 17:05.200
Mr. Kang, why didn't you inform me
before you came?

17:05.280 --> 17:07.480
I heard Clear Mind's new glass pieces

17:07.560 --> 17:08.520
are nice and cheap.

17:09.160 --> 17:10.240
Ms. Su.

17:10.319 --> 17:12.040
Can you show me?

17:12.560 --> 17:14.720
Mr. Kang, I didn't expect you

17:14.800 --> 17:16.800
to be interested in it.

17:17.319 --> 17:18.960
-Wait a minute.
-It's delicate.

17:22.720 --> 17:23.599
Thank you.

17:29.040 --> 17:30.320
-Mr. Kang, here you are.
-Take care.

17:30.400 --> 17:32.840
Do you like it?

17:37.600 --> 17:39.200
Here you are.

17:39.920 --> 17:41.680
-It's beautiful.
-Okay.

17:42.200 --> 17:44.240
-Have a look.
-Is this the only one?

17:44.320 --> 17:46.600
I want a thousand sets
to be delivered in a month.

17:49.840 --> 17:51.400
One month?

17:52.000 --> 17:54.080
If I take your order,

17:54.160 --> 17:55.920
I'll have to delay

17:56.000 --> 17:57.000
the previous customer's orders.

17:57.800 --> 17:59.520
Clear Mind will lose credit.

18:00.760 --> 18:02.040
If you want 1,000 sets,

18:03.600 --> 18:07.200
I think it will take us
more than three months.

18:07.280 --> 18:08.520
No, more than three months.

18:09.080 --> 18:11.200
Can you wait for more than three months?

18:11.280 --> 18:13.120
If you can't,
we'll work together next time.

18:13.720 --> 18:15.080
It's a big order.

18:15.960 --> 18:17.640
Aren't you worried about offending me?

18:18.600 --> 18:20.000
I'm worried,

18:20.520 --> 18:24.360
but Clear Mind is a small shop.
We value credit.

18:28.440 --> 18:29.880
If you just said yes,

18:29.960 --> 18:32.840
that's our last deal.

18:33.520 --> 18:34.880
I'll give you three months.

18:34.960 --> 18:37.240
I'll send someone to pick them up
in three months.

18:39.760 --> 18:41.640
Mr. Kang, I'll get a contract for you.

18:41.720 --> 18:42.800
Okay.

18:46.280 --> 18:47.320
Thank you.

18:57.160 --> 18:59.080
Gaoshou, take it easy.

18:59.160 --> 19:00.960
Don't tremble your mouth.

19:01.040 --> 19:02.600
-I'm not.
-Don't tremble your mouth.

19:02.680 --> 19:03.520
Don't be nervous.

19:03.600 --> 19:06.600
Yingtao, your left eyebrow. No.

19:06.680 --> 19:07.520
Your right eyebrow.

19:08.040 --> 19:09.600
Lower your right eyebrow a little bit.

19:10.680 --> 19:12.720
Lower. Lift the left corner of your mouth.

19:16.440 --> 19:17.560
No, right corner.

19:19.600 --> 19:20.920
It's good.

19:21.000 --> 19:23.720
Don't be nervous, you two.

19:24.280 --> 19:25.280
I'm not nervous.

19:26.720 --> 19:28.920
-Look here.
-Duanwu, we're here.

19:29.000 --> 19:31.320
-Do your clothes fit?
-Yes.

19:31.400 --> 19:33.640
-Let me see.
-Mr. Qin.

19:34.520 --> 19:35.840
-It fits you well.
-No.

19:35.920 --> 19:37.400
It's good.

19:37.480 --> 19:39.320
-Come on.
-What are you painting?

19:39.400 --> 19:40.400
Come here.

19:41.080 --> 19:42.520
-It fits you well.
-I have one more…

19:42.600 --> 19:44.800
-It's good.
-It's okay. We'll talk about it later.

19:46.160 --> 19:47.960
Supervisor Kang, come on.

19:48.880 --> 19:51.640
-Coming.
-It's not over yet.

19:51.720 --> 19:52.720
I'm not playing with you.

19:52.800 --> 19:54.240
I want to paint a portrait.

19:56.160 --> 19:57.400
Won't you join us?

19:58.920 --> 20:01.200
I won't join you.

20:02.160 --> 20:03.200
All right.

20:10.240 --> 20:11.400
Come on.

20:14.160 --> 20:15.680
Am I late?

20:16.280 --> 20:18.320
You're just in time.

20:19.400 --> 20:20.440
Supervisor Kang.

20:20.960 --> 20:22.920
It will take two hours.

20:23.000 --> 20:25.840
Find a place to sit.

20:26.640 --> 20:27.480
Come here.

20:28.000 --> 20:29.160
Otherwise, your legs…

20:29.240 --> 20:31.840
My legs? Okay.

20:31.920 --> 20:34.200
I have the best legs in the West Regions.

20:35.800 --> 20:37.880
-Be careful.
-It's good.

20:41.640 --> 20:43.960
Your intimacy. It's good.

20:47.160 --> 20:48.360
Stand still.

20:48.440 --> 20:49.800
Stand still.

20:51.200 --> 20:52.560
Is everyone here?

20:52.640 --> 20:53.640
Let's get started.

20:53.720 --> 20:55.720
-Here.
-We're all here.

21:08.800 --> 21:09.880
Come on.

21:09.960 --> 21:13.560
I still have work to do.

21:15.000 --> 21:16.840
Mr. Qin can't hold back anymore.

21:33.760 --> 21:34.760
Yingtao.

21:35.960 --> 21:38.400
Is that your double chin?

21:40.120 --> 21:42.320
Yunxiu, I told you he painted me fat.

21:42.400 --> 21:44.080
No. It's beautiful.

21:44.160 --> 21:46.000
-Yeah. Your teeth are white.
-Really?

21:46.080 --> 21:47.800
Gaoshou.
Why didn't you look at the Yingtao?

21:48.400 --> 21:50.360
-I…
-I wanted to ignore him.

21:50.440 --> 21:52.120
I wanted to pretend to be deep.

21:53.200 --> 21:55.200
I have a question.

21:55.920 --> 21:59.120
Am I usually so handsome?

21:59.920 --> 22:02.560
Supervisor Kang's head is tilted.

22:02.640 --> 22:04.800
I didn't even notice it.
His head was tilted the whole time.

22:04.880 --> 22:06.400
You're not as handsome as Du Ming.

22:06.480 --> 22:09.520
Wait. Look at Zhang Jinran.
He doesn't look like an official.

22:10.400 --> 22:13.960
Mr. Zhang's head is as thick as his head.

22:15.320 --> 22:16.920
Ms. Su is beautiful.

22:18.400 --> 22:19.520
Duanwu is so beautiful.

22:19.600 --> 22:21.480
-The painting looks exactly like her.
-You and him are a good match.

22:22.080 --> 22:23.880
No, the painting is nice.

22:24.840 --> 22:26.080
I'll go to that painter

22:26.160 --> 22:27.720
and paint a portrait for myself.

22:29.280 --> 22:31.240
-Supervisor Kang, are you addicted?
-Good.

22:31.840 --> 22:32.800
It's beautiful.

22:32.880 --> 22:34.800
Supervisor Kang,
you're whiter in the painting.

22:34.880 --> 22:35.960
Supervisor Kang.

22:36.480 --> 22:38.080
Your legs are not good. Walk slowly.

22:38.160 --> 22:40.160
-Walk slowly.
-Don't fall again.

22:40.240 --> 22:41.560
You're on crutches.

22:45.360 --> 22:47.760
They look happy.

22:49.840 --> 22:52.240
I didn't expect them to like it so much.

22:52.320 --> 22:55.040
Since they like it,
we'll paint another one next year.

22:55.120 --> 22:56.120
We'll paint one every year.

22:56.200 --> 22:58.720
Clear Mind's business
will get bigger and bigger.

22:58.800 --> 23:00.120
There will be more and more people.

23:00.200 --> 23:01.400
One painting can't fit everyone.

23:02.880 --> 23:04.160
Don't be silly.

23:04.680 --> 23:06.840
We can paint a large painting.

23:06.920 --> 23:10.040
This wide. Or this wide.
It will fit everyone.

23:10.120 --> 23:12.320
It will take a little longer.

23:12.920 --> 23:16.520
-We will sit.
-It's good.

23:21.720 --> 23:24.480
Painting brings us good luck.

23:25.080 --> 23:26.720
I'm telling you.

23:27.800 --> 23:30.480
You hung the painting well this year.

23:31.000 --> 23:33.520
You will also hang
the next year's painting.

23:40.080 --> 23:41.200
Let's talk about it next year.

23:41.280 --> 23:43.320
It depends on my mood.

23:43.400 --> 23:44.960
What do you mean by that?

23:46.440 --> 23:48.920
-What's wrong?
-That won't do.

23:49.440 --> 23:53.000
I'm taking you as a waiter at Clear Mind.

23:53.080 --> 23:54.280
It's not like you'll not be at Clear Mind.

23:55.240 --> 23:56.760
I'm just a waiter?

23:56.840 --> 23:58.240
I should be a manager at worst.

24:00.120 --> 24:02.200
I can't afford to pay a manager.

24:04.080 --> 24:05.920
Money doesn't matter.

24:06.960 --> 24:09.680
Ms. Su.

24:10.200 --> 24:12.640
I want you to give me a job for life.

24:31.120 --> 24:32.240
Look.

24:33.040 --> 24:35.400
Zhang Jin looks much taller than me.

24:44.400 --> 24:45.560
His hat is tall.

25:00.280 --> 25:01.440
Look.

25:01.520 --> 25:04.040
I'm handsome in the painting.

25:04.640 --> 25:05.840
I'm tall and mighty.

25:12.360 --> 25:14.040
The painting painted us well,

25:14.760 --> 25:15.840
especially you and me.

25:17.920 --> 25:18.960
It's nice.

25:27.000 --> 25:28.200
Ninety-eight…

25:28.800 --> 25:29.680
Fifty…

25:30.320 --> 25:31.360
Ms. Su.

25:35.120 --> 25:36.360
These are samples.

25:36.440 --> 25:38.160
I put the rest in the backyard.

25:38.240 --> 25:39.640
With these raw materials,

25:39.720 --> 25:41.160
we can fill Mr. Kang's order.

25:41.240 --> 25:43.960
And the rest can be made into jewelry.

25:44.040 --> 25:46.280
Clear Mind's
glass crown and belt were sold out

25:46.360 --> 25:48.360
as soon as they hit the shelves.

25:48.440 --> 25:51.280
Clear Mind is finally in luck.

25:53.960 --> 25:54.920
Ms. Su.

25:55.000 --> 25:57.000
When I came back just now,

25:57.080 --> 25:58.880
I found that the Zhenlang Pavilion
was not open.

26:05.680 --> 26:07.000
It's not open?

26:10.920 --> 26:12.360
Open the door.

26:13.120 --> 26:15.200
Open up. There's big business coming.

26:16.560 --> 26:19.640
Clear Mind wants to buy Zhenlang Pavilion
at a high price.

26:19.720 --> 26:22.280
This is your last chance.

26:23.920 --> 26:25.320
Who said we wanted
to sell Zhenlang Pavilion?

26:26.160 --> 26:27.360
If you're not selling it,

26:27.440 --> 26:29.440
why don't you open the door
and do business?

26:30.120 --> 26:31.000
It has nothing to do with you.

26:33.240 --> 26:34.080
Wait.

26:34.760 --> 26:36.360
IS Zhenlang Pavilion for sale?

26:36.440 --> 26:39.280
If you don't do business,
you'd better sell it to me.

26:39.360 --> 26:41.320
Even if you don't sell it to me,

26:41.400 --> 26:43.280
someone else will buy it.

26:43.960 --> 26:47.480
You're wasting your shop.

26:48.120 --> 26:49.640
This table is nice.

26:50.800 --> 26:53.160
-We need a table.
-You…

26:56.640 --> 26:57.840
Cui Shijiu.

26:59.040 --> 27:00.640
Why are you hiding?

27:11.080 --> 27:12.160
Tong.

27:13.880 --> 27:15.680
Send them away.

27:15.760 --> 27:17.560
Did you hear it? Get out.

27:17.640 --> 27:18.840
I'm begging you.

27:26.120 --> 27:28.160
If you're just looking
for a place to stay,

27:30.960 --> 27:32.480
you should continue
to be the Cui's legitimate daughter

27:33.920 --> 27:35.200
and rely on the Zheng family.

27:36.160 --> 27:38.680
If you want to start all over again,

27:41.680 --> 27:43.640
run Zhenlang Pavilion well.

27:47.680 --> 27:49.160
Get out. Stop it.

27:51.080 --> 27:54.400
Cui Shijiu, your time is running out.

28:10.400 --> 28:13.280
Ms. Su, why do we always help her?

28:13.360 --> 28:14.760
She deserves it.

28:19.160 --> 28:21.000
Zhenlang Pavilion's situation

28:23.920 --> 28:25.280
will affect our business.

28:39.720 --> 28:40.680
Tell me.

28:43.960 --> 28:45.800
Why does she get everything

28:46.680 --> 28:48.040
she wants?

28:49.880 --> 28:52.400
Why can't I get

28:53.360 --> 28:55.160
what I want?

28:56.440 --> 28:58.480
Am I wrong?

29:02.560 --> 29:04.760
Or is it something I want wrong?

29:09.120 --> 29:10.160
Zhenlang Pavilion.

29:13.840 --> 29:15.320
Zhenlang Pavilion.

29:17.400 --> 29:19.720
All I did was to get you.

29:25.080 --> 29:26.880
Now, I finally got you.

29:29.760 --> 29:32.080
I own Zhenlang Pavilion.

29:42.120 --> 29:44.400
But I'm alone.

29:48.480 --> 29:49.760
Mother.

29:52.120 --> 29:53.400
Father.

29:55.360 --> 29:56.640
Wu.

29:59.800 --> 30:02.200
I finally got Zhenlang Pavilion.

30:03.280 --> 30:05.640
But I'm alone.

30:06.240 --> 30:07.440
In that case,

30:08.360 --> 30:10.480
I don't need you.

30:25.960 --> 30:28.760
I don't want you.

30:29.280 --> 30:30.360
I don't want you.

30:32.000 --> 30:33.440
I don't want Zhenlang Pavilion.

30:35.160 --> 30:36.080
I don't want it.

30:41.160 --> 30:43.280
I want them back.

30:45.920 --> 30:47.640
I want my mother.

30:49.160 --> 30:50.800
I want my father.

30:52.200 --> 30:54.160
I want them back.

30:55.240 --> 30:57.080
I want them back.

31:07.680 --> 31:10.040
I don't want it.

31:11.120 --> 31:13.240
I don't want it.

31:13.920 --> 31:15.440
I don't want it.

31:16.280 --> 31:18.880
I don't want it.

31:27.280 --> 31:28.440
The glass is transparent.

31:28.520 --> 31:30.200
Ms. Su, our goods arrived.

31:30.280 --> 31:31.640
Duanwu, have a look.

31:32.240 --> 31:33.760
Are those raw materials?

31:34.680 --> 31:37.200
These raw materials
are from the Kang royal family.

31:37.280 --> 31:38.960
They must be good.

31:39.040 --> 31:41.520
They are of good quality.
We can make good glassware.

31:41.600 --> 31:43.160
Time is tight.

31:43.240 --> 31:44.600
Should we hire some people to help you?

31:44.680 --> 31:47.400
We have to train new recruits.
And they are not necessarily reliable.

31:47.480 --> 31:49.360
It's okay.
We have Mr. Qin, a veteran expert.

31:49.440 --> 31:51.560
We can finish it by working overtime.

31:51.640 --> 31:53.040
Why didn't Mr. Qin come out?

31:53.120 --> 31:55.560
The glass is good.
He'll be so happy to see it.

31:55.640 --> 31:57.920
He didn't come today.
I sent Gaoshou to go to him.

31:59.120 --> 32:01.200
Mr. Qin is usually the first to arrive.

32:01.280 --> 32:02.760
Is he sick?

32:03.880 --> 32:05.920
Gaoshou, where is Mr. Qin?

32:06.000 --> 32:08.080
Where is he?

32:08.160 --> 32:09.520
I asked you to go to him.

32:09.600 --> 32:12.760
I did. His daughter wasn't at home.
And I didn't see him.

32:12.840 --> 32:14.920
I thought he was here.

32:15.000 --> 32:17.800
We're on a deadline. Where did he go?

32:18.640 --> 32:19.600
I don't know.

32:27.320 --> 32:28.440
Yunxiu.

32:28.520 --> 32:29.760
Go to Mr. Zhang

32:29.840 --> 32:31.000
and ask him to come to Clear Mind.

32:31.080 --> 32:32.600
Mr. Qin left suddenly

32:32.680 --> 32:34.520
without telling anyone.

32:34.600 --> 32:35.960
It's weird.

32:36.560 --> 32:38.240
Yingtao, stay in the shop.

32:38.320 --> 32:40.040
Tell Mr. Yan about it when he gets back.

32:40.120 --> 32:41.480
Gaoshou, come with me.

32:41.560 --> 32:42.760
Ms. Su.

32:42.840 --> 32:44.320
Why don't you wait for Mr. Yan?

32:44.400 --> 32:46.240
Don't worry, Yingtao.

32:46.320 --> 32:47.880
I'll go with Ms. Su.

32:48.480 --> 32:49.320
What can you do?

32:49.400 --> 32:50.720
I can do anything. Let's go, Ms. Su.

32:51.640 --> 32:53.040
Let's go.

32:53.120 --> 32:55.320
-Take good care of Ms. Su.
-Rest assured.

33:01.280 --> 33:04.240
Why did Mr. Qin suddenly return
to his hometown?

33:04.320 --> 33:05.520
Don't worry, Ms. Su.

33:05.600 --> 33:08.640
This is the only way to Zizhou.

33:08.720 --> 33:11.080
We'll catch up with him. Don't worry.

33:11.160 --> 33:12.240
What do you want?

33:12.760 --> 33:13.720
Let go of me.

33:15.600 --> 33:17.040
What do you want?

33:17.120 --> 33:18.640
Let go of me.

33:20.000 --> 33:21.920
Ms. Su, something is going on over there.
I'll check it out.

33:22.000 --> 33:23.720
I'll be back in a minute.
Wait for me in the carriage.

33:46.400 --> 33:47.480
Gaoshou!

33:53.160 --> 33:55.000
-Wait here.
-Yes, ma'am.

34:01.400 --> 34:02.640
Gaoshou!

34:09.000 --> 34:09.960
Gaoshou!

34:23.440 --> 34:26.600
Gaoshou. Gaoshou, wake up.

34:58.240 --> 34:59.240
Su Muzhe.

34:59.320 --> 35:02.000
You killed my two sons.

35:02.080 --> 35:04.000
You made me, Zheng Shiyuan,
lose my offspring.

35:04.080 --> 35:05.480
Today,

35:06.320 --> 35:08.400
either you get down on your knees

35:08.920 --> 35:10.800
and apologize to them

35:10.880 --> 35:12.000
or…

35:14.360 --> 35:16.240
I'll bury you here.

35:33.320 --> 35:34.520
Zheng Shiyuan.

35:36.040 --> 35:38.200
Don't pretend to be a good father.

35:39.520 --> 35:42.040
You know how your two sons died.

35:43.720 --> 35:46.560
The person
who should kneel is you, not me.

35:47.680 --> 35:49.040
Drop the act.

35:49.120 --> 35:51.320
You want my blood-stained pearl.

35:52.760 --> 35:53.600
Right?

35:57.440 --> 35:58.320
Su Muzhe.

35:59.360 --> 36:00.720
You made my two sons

36:00.800 --> 36:03.240
unable to enter the ancestral hall
after they died.

36:04.320 --> 36:06.360
Do you know how sad I am?

36:07.800 --> 36:12.120
You, give everything at Clear Mind to me

36:12.200 --> 36:14.520
and get out of Yangzhou.

36:14.600 --> 36:18.960
-Maybe I'll spare your life.
-You killed your sons.

36:19.040 --> 36:23.720
It's you, Zheng Shiyuan.
You killed your sons.

36:25.440 --> 36:27.200
You want my Clear Mind.

36:29.800 --> 36:31.080
Dream on.

36:36.920 --> 36:38.640
Master, the savior is coming.

36:52.600 --> 36:54.920
Let go of me.

36:55.600 --> 36:56.560
Let go of me!

37:35.400 --> 37:38.160
Are you saying that she and Gaoshou
went to chase Mr. Qin?

37:38.240 --> 37:41.080
Yes. Ms. Su said we couldn't delay.
So, they went to chase him.

37:41.160 --> 37:43.000
She was too reckless.
What if they encounter bad people?

37:43.080 --> 37:44.840
CLEAR MIND

37:44.920 --> 37:45.920
They haven't come back yet?

37:46.640 --> 37:48.920
-What took them so long?
-I don't know.

37:49.440 --> 37:51.480
-I'll go find them.
-Don't rush.

37:51.560 --> 37:52.840
Let's go to the glass shop first.

37:52.920 --> 37:54.360
What if they're already back?

37:56.320 --> 37:58.120
-Okay, let's go.
-Go.

37:58.200 --> 37:59.840
-I'll go with you.
-Stay here and watch the shop.

38:06.880 --> 38:08.000
Help!

38:09.200 --> 38:10.640
Help!

38:11.240 --> 38:13.240
Hello? Help!

38:34.200 --> 38:36.360
-Where is your father?
-I'm looking for him, too.

38:36.440 --> 38:37.840
Where did he go?

38:37.920 --> 38:40.120
Neighbors said he went out in the morning

38:40.200 --> 38:41.200
and said he was going back
to his hometown.

38:41.280 --> 38:42.360
Go back to his hometown?

38:42.440 --> 38:46.320
Is Mr. Qin a bait?

38:51.680 --> 38:53.240
Zheng Shiyuan.

39:14.680 --> 39:17.720
Mr. Zheng. Did you make it?

39:17.800 --> 39:19.840
You startled me.

39:22.960 --> 39:24.360
With your help,

39:24.440 --> 39:26.280
Su Muzhe will die.

39:27.040 --> 39:27.880
Where is the stuff?

39:30.200 --> 39:32.080
I'm the only one in the world

39:32.160 --> 39:34.320
who can tell if it's real.

39:38.200 --> 39:40.440
It's just a blood-soaked jade bead.

39:40.520 --> 39:42.000
It's unlucky.

39:42.800 --> 39:44.000
Why do you want it?

39:44.600 --> 39:46.840
Do you want to ruin our business?

39:57.440 --> 40:00.240
The Zheng family made many mistakes.

40:00.320 --> 40:02.360
You redeemed yourself

40:02.440 --> 40:03.960
by finding the blood-stained pearl.

40:05.400 --> 40:06.920
When can I meet the savior?

40:07.600 --> 40:08.640
Wait.

40:42.840 --> 40:43.960
Well.

40:44.840 --> 40:46.360
I want to take you to a place.

40:46.440 --> 40:50.360
We'll go to a place
where there are just the two of us.

40:52.960 --> 40:54.520
When we get there,

40:55.040 --> 40:56.600
I'm not Zheng Wu

40:57.120 --> 40:58.640
and you're not Cui Shijiu.

40:59.400 --> 41:02.360
We can live our own lives.

41:06.200 --> 41:07.160
Wu.

41:10.760 --> 41:12.000
I'd rather die

41:12.760 --> 41:15.480
than let anyone hurt Cui Shijiu.

41:19.080 --> 41:20.920
Shijiu…

41:22.000 --> 41:27.960
Stay alive…

41:35.520 --> 41:36.640
Zhuohua.

41:39.120 --> 41:40.800
Your name is Cui Zhuohua.

41:41.720 --> 41:43.560
You're not just Cui Shijiu.

41:45.360 --> 41:46.600
Remember.

42:25.160 --> 42:29.120
Wu, I'll pick myself up and live.

42:29.800 --> 42:31.160
For you

42:32.960 --> 42:34.640
and for myself.

42:37.800 --> 42:38.760
Tong.

42:40.840 --> 42:41.920
Lady Shijiu.

42:42.560 --> 42:43.480
Lady Shijiu.

42:44.400 --> 42:45.640
Go get Garuda.

42:46.560 --> 42:48.160
Yes, I'll open the door for business.

42:48.240 --> 42:50.120
I ask you to get Garuda.

42:56.600 --> 43:01.200
Don't we open the door? Are you going to…?

43:03.880 --> 43:06.400
Yes, I will get Garuda.

43:22.960 --> 43:24.640
Help me do my hair.

43:25.800 --> 43:26.800
Yes, ma'am.
